## T0001 -- a value of another type than expected (here a str for an int parameter, or an if with an int and a str branch).
## command: lume build   (this file shows the diagnostic: the gate runs a copy named .src; T0001_type_error.fixed.src is the corrected program)
## fix: pass a value of the expected type
fn twice(n: int) -> int = n * 2
print twice("4")
